{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2022-05-24 17:30:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES FINAL MAY CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® PREMIUM MONEY MARKET ETF', 'text': 'TORONTO, MAY 24, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FINAL MAY 2022 CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES PREMIUM MONEY MARKET ETF. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD ON MAY 25, 2022 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE ON MAY 31, 2022.'}